-- SECTION 1: KERNEL-PROVEN 4-BIT GENERALIZED-CONDITION FIBER ALGEBRA (L & Q)
--   Bit k in {0,1,2,3} of mask m in 0..15 encodes concrete pair (k>>1, k&1):
--     bit 0 (1): (0,0)='0'   bit 1 (2): (0,1)='n'   bit 2 (4): (1,0)='u'   bit 3 (8): (1,1)='1'
